<view class="container">
  <view class="page-content">
    <view class="current-plan">
      <view class="current-badge">当前方案</view>
      <view class="current-plan-icon"><icon name="{{currentPlan.icon}}" size="36" color="#FFFFFF" /></view>
      <view class="current-plan-info">
        <view class="current-plan-name">{{currentPlan.name}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-title">选择新方案</view>

    <view class="plans-section">
      <view
        wx:for="{{availablePlans}}"
        wx:key="tier"
        class="plan-card"
        style="border-color: {{selectedTier === item.tier ? '#3370FF' : 'transparent'}}; background: {{selectedTier === item.tier ? '#E8F0FE' : '#fff'}};"
        catchtap="selectPlan"
        data-tier="{{item.tier}}"
      >
        <view class="plan-icon-wrapper" style="background: {{item.iconBg}};">
          <text wx:if="{{item.tier === 'free'}}" class="free-tag">FREE</text>
          <icon wx:else name="{{item.icon}}" size="36" color="#FFFFFF" />
        </view>
        <view class="plan-details">
          <view class="plan-card-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="plan-card-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="plan-tag {{item.tagType}}">{{item.tagText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="notice-card downgrade-card">
      <view class="notice-header">
        <view class="notice-icon"><icon name="warning" size="36" color="#F7BA1E" /></view>
        <text class="notice-title">降级须知</text>
      </view>
      <view class="notice-list">
        <text>• 降级将在当前周期结束后生效{{currentPeriodEnd ? '（' + currentPeriodEnd + '）' : ''}}</text>
        <text>• 超出限额的宠物数据将保留但不可新增</text>
        <text>• Pro专属功能（血统证书等）将不可访问</text>
        <text>• 剩余天数的差价不退还</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="notice-card upgrade-card">
      <view class="notice-header">
        <view class="notice-icon"><icon name="trending" size="32" color="#2BA471" /></view>
        <text class="notice-title">升级规则</text>
      </view>
      <view class="notice-list">
        <text>• 升级立即生效</text>
        <text>• 按剩余天数计算差价</text>
        <text>• Pro功能即时解锁</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="confirm-btn" bindtap="confirmChange">确认变更</button>
  </view>
</view>
